title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">11.50.6055<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">December 5, 2017<br/>Winter Update 2017</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Objects<span class=\"explained\">Help</span></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-object-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20171113224125&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Explosive_Barrel_Quest_59da4a.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see an explosive barrel.<div class=\"p-weight\"></div><div class=\"p-flavortext\">This dwarven barrel is highly explosive and instable. It's literally only a matter of time until it goes off.</div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Gnome%20Deep%20Hub\">Gnome Deep Hub</a>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>When used at the correct location, it will explode (<span class=\"tibiatext tibiaorange\">KABOOM!</span>) after 5 seconds. When activated, it looks like this:<br/>\n<span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Explosive Barrel\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Explosive_Barrel_b4064f.gif\" width=\"64\"/></span>\nThey are part of the Dangerous Depths Quest - Explosive Growth.\n</p>\n<figure class=\"thumb mw-halign-right show-info-icon\" style=\"width: 180px\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"> <img alt=\"An Explosive Barrel exploding. The damage taken can be reduced by wearing Fire protection equipment.\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"132\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Dangerous_Depths_Growth_c6af6b.png\" width=\"180\"/> <figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> <svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg> <p class=\"caption\">An Explosive Barrel exploding. The damage taken can be reduced by wearing Fire protection equipment.</p> </figcaption> </figure>\n<p><span style=\"line-height: 20px; margin-top: 13px;\"><i> <b>See also:</b> Explosive Barrel </i> </span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div class=\"history-section\" id=\"w-object-history\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-History\">History</span></h3>\n<p>It also used to deal 1000 <a href=\"#/wiki/Fire%20Damage\">Fire Damage</a> when exploding, but this was removed in the end of 2018, but the change was not announced.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Pages\">Related Pages</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body navigation-list-wrapper\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Containers\">Containers</a></li><li><a href=\"#/quest/dangerous-depths-quest\">Dangerous Depths Quest</a></li><li>Explosive Barrel</li><li>Other Objects</li></ul>\n</div>\n</div></div></div>","quests":["dangerous-depths-quest"],"howto":{"quests":[{"slug":"dangerous-depths-quest","quest":"Dangerous Depths Quest","step":"4-2","n":22,"title":"Explosive Growth: rebentar as esponjas","kind":"mention","coords":[]}]}}